Give the platform administrator the ability to manage:
- Subscription plan names.
- Monthly and annual prices.
- Weekly or quarterly billing options where enabled.
- Unit and property limits.
- Staff and professional account limits.
- Feature entitlements.
- Free usage allowances.
- Add-on services.
- Overage charges.
- Promotional offers.
- Discount codes.
- Enterprise quotations.
- Subscription grace periods.

Maintain historical pricing versions so existing subscriptions and past invoices remain auditable.

Create internal commercial analytics to track:
- Free-to-paid conversion.
- Monthly recurring revenue.
- Annual recurring revenue.
- Revenue by plan.
- Churn.
- Renewal rates.
- Average revenue per professional account.
- Cost per active unit.
