## 10.25 Final development instruction

Do not build EstateDesk as a basic rent reminder application.

Build it as a complete, secure and commercially sustainable real estate operations ecosystem.

Prioritize data integrity, ease of use, mobile performance, tenant privacy, property ownership rights, accurate payment verification, dependable reminders and scalable portfolio management.

All subscription prices, plan limits, feature entitlements, notification allowances and enterprise commercial terms must be configurable from the administration portal.

Use the proposed Free, ₦2,000 Basic, ₦7,500 Professional and ₦15,000 Portfolio structure as the initial commercial configuration, subject to validation.

Deliver a production-quality application with a consistent user experience across iOS, Android and web, backed by a secure and maintainable architecture.

Do not omit any requirement above. Where a third-party integration, legal requirement, pricing assumption or technical capability needs validation, identify it clearly rather than pretending it has already been implemented or verified.